# The platform's env vars. `.env` is gitignored — copy this file to `.env`
# and fill in the real values. `VITE_`-prefixed vars are inlined into the
# bundle at build time.

# The web-restricted Google Maps JavaScript API key (tracking doc §4, key
# "Web (domains)"). The fulfillment sheet's destination pin renders only
# when this is present; without it the sheet degrades honestly to the
# coordinates link. Restrict it to your deployed domain(s) + localhost.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
